        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-446 (ensure controlled execution — Inter-Entity Service Level &amp; Billing (PA-72.2).) | - CTL-446 (SLA-penalty accuracy); operational: Finance Controller quarterly SLA-review sign-off
Owner: Finance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
