        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-446 (ensure controlled execution — Inter-Entity Service Level &amp; Billing (PA-72.2).) | - CTL-446 (transfer-pricing arm&#x27;s-length — links to W235); operational: CFO + CIO sign-off on go-live after parallel-run validation
Owner: Finance Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
